an><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.5 kg (1 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 14 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  14  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-ee429179f7419fddEND_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-783074bd06ad7139END_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">S_CHA_NarrativeLoot_TalisCards</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_CHA_NarrativeLoot_TalisCards\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_CHA_NarrativeLoot_TalisCards\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">00e37274-e954-485c-9774-ecc71b4ae039</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:00e37274-e954-485c-9774-ecc71b4ae039\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:00e37274-e954-485c-9774-ecc71b4ae039\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Carried by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Quelenna\" title=\"Quelenna\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Portrait_Quelenna.png/25px-Portrait_Quelenna.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Portrait_Quelenna.png/38px-Portrait_Quelenna.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Portrait_Quelenna.png/50px-Portrait_Quelenna.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Quelenna\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Portrait_Quelenna.png/25px-Portrait_Quelenna.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e3/Portrait_Quelenna.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Quelenna\" title=\"Quelenna\">Quelenna</a>, one of the looters at the <a href=\"/wiki/Chapel_Entrance\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Chapel Entrance\">Chapel Entrance</a> of the <a href=\"/wiki/Overgrown_Ruins\" title=\"Overgrown Ruins\">Overgrown Ruins</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[Each page in this illustrated book describes the meaning of a different Talis card. A message has been penned down on the title page:] \n</p><p><br>\nMy dearest Quelenna,\n</p><p><br>\nWhile you were sleeping, I did another Talis reading. I half expected to draw the fool, because that is what I feel like, and what is your venture if not reckless? Instead, I drew these:\n</p><p><br>\nThe Ten of Waves - meaning divine love, bliss, or illusions\n</p><p>The Comet - meaning riches found, or fulfilled wishes\n</p><p>Death - meaning new beginnings\n</p><p><br>\nThe suit of Waves resembles love, and I know what we have is still frail, but... can you blame my heart for beating faster when I saw these cards? I've been staring at them for an hour, and I need to go (the cups aren't going to clean themselves), but I know that when I come back home tonight, you will be gone.\n</p><p><br>\nBut when you return, will you tell me if you feel the same, or if this was all just a blissful illusion?\n</p><p><br>\nI love you,\n</p><p>Alys\n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>See also:\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Talis\" title=\"Talis\">Talis</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Talis_Tactics_-_Ultimate_Trick_Book\" title=\"Talis Tactics - Ultimate Trick Book\">Talis Tactics - Ultimate Trick Book</a></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714234318\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.053 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.055 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1796/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 32769/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 11171/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory